  "title": "Amneal to Participate in Goldman Sachs 47th Annual Global Healthcare Conference 2026",
  "summary": "BRIDGEWATER, N.J., June 01, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Amneal Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (Nasdaq: AMRX) (“Amneal” or the “Company”), today announced that Chirag Patel, Co-Chief Executive and President, will participate and present at Goldman Sachs 47 th Annual Global Healthcare Conference 2026 being held on June 8-10 at the Loews Miami Beach Hotel in Miami, FL. A company presentation will take place on Tuesday June 9, 2026, at 8:40AM EDT. A live webcast of the presentation will be available here . About",
